<span id="S2.T2.6.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T2.6.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:80%;">FedFaSt<span id="S2.T2.6.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> (prior)</span></span></span>
</span></td>
